      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "There is also a business-class possibility via Istanbul, but it changes the trip substantially: it requires a separate SFO–Los Angeles positioning flight that leaves at 6:18 a.m., then a 12:45 p.m. departure from LAX. The whole journey spans 35 hours 32 minutes and reaches Bangkok at 8:50 a.m. on January 17. The cabin upgrade may appeal if comfort outweighs the much earlier start, extra travel time, and substantially higher points cost.",
