    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "text": "Positioning flight: SFO–LAX, January 15, 6:18–7:46 a.m., reported fare USD 86. After a 4-hour-59-minute gap, the Turkish Airlines award departs LAX at 12:45 p.m., connects in Istanbul, and arrives in Bangkok January 17 at 8:50 a.m. The award is 275,000 Turkish miles; award taxes and fees are not reported. The award itinerary is labeled business at journey level, but cabin is not specified separately for each flight.",
      "label": "Business via Los Angeles",
      "reference_kind": "journey",
